SUMMARY:Wednesday Night Indoor Volleyball | Montopolis | 6v6
DESCRIPTION:Austin Indoor Volleyball – Montopolis\n🏐 Wednesday Indoor
  Volleyball – Montopolis Rec Center\n\nCome join us for some fun indoor 
 volleyball! All beginner to intermediate players are welcome.\n\n📍 Loca
 tion: Montopolis Recreation Center\, Austin\n📅 Date: Wednesday\, Octobe
 r 14\n🕕 Time: 6:00–8:30 PM\n\nWhat to expect:\n\n- Friendly indoor vo
 lleyball with a goal of playing 6 vs. 6.\n- We have one court available.\n
 - If we have more than 12 players\, we'll rotate teams so everyone gets a 
 chance to play.\n- We already have approximately 8 players planning to att
 end\, and we'd love to get more!\n\n🏐 When you arrive:\n\nPlease sign i
 n at the front desk using the sign-in sheet\, then head straight to the gy
 m to join us.\n\n✅ Please RSVP!\n\nSign up as soon as possible so everyo
 ne can see how many players are coming. If your plans change\, please upda
 te your RSVP.\n\nCome solo or bring a friend! Let's meet new people\, stay
  active\, and enjoy some good volleyball.\n\nSee you on the court! 🙌
